#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:1
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "预备知识"

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:3
msgid ""
"Restricted Boltzmann Machine (RBM) is an energy-based probabilistic "
"graphical model, composed of a visible layer and a hidden layer, with no "
"connections within each layer and full connections between layers. Its core "
"objective is to learn the latent feature distribution of data through "
"unsupervised learning."
msgstr ""
"受限玻尔兹曼机（Restricted Boltzmann Machine，RBM）是一种基于能量的概率图模型，由可见层（Visible "
"Layer）和隐层（Hidden Layer）组成，层内无连接、层间全连接。其核心目标是通过无监督学习学习数据的潜在特征分布。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:7
msgid "1. Neural Network Basics"
msgstr "1\\. 神经网络基础"

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:9
msgid "1.1 Neuron Model"
msgstr "1.1 神经元模型"

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:11
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"An artificial neuron is the basic computational unit of a neural network. "
"Given an input vector $\\mathbf{x} \\in \\mathbb{R}^n$, its output is:"
msgstr "人工神经元是神经网络的基本计算单元。给定输入向量 $\\mathbf{x} \\in \\mathbb{R}^n$，其输出为："

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:13
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"a = \\phi\\left( \\mathbf{w}^\\top \\mathbf{x} + b \\right)\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"a = \\phi\\left( \\mathbf{w}^\\top \\mathbf{x} + b \\right)\n"

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:17
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"where $\\mathbf{w} \\in \\mathbb{R}^n$ is the weight vector, $b \\in "
"\\mathbb{R}$ is the bias, and $\\phi(\\cdot)$ is the activation function. In"
" probabilistic generative models, the Sigmoid activation function is "
"commonly used:"
msgstr ""
"其中 $\\mathbf{w} \\in \\mathbb{R}^n$ 为权重向量，$b \\in \\mathbb{R}$ "
"为偏置项，$\\phi(\\cdot)$ 为激活函数。在概率生成模型中，通常使用 Sigmoid 激活函数："

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:19
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\sigma(z) = \\frac{1}{1 + e^{-z}}\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\sigma(z) = \\frac{1}{1 + e^{-z}}\n"

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:23
msgid "1.2 Energy-Based Models"
msgstr "1.2 基于能量的模型"

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:25
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Unlike feedforward networks, Energy-Based Models (EBMs) define a probability"
" distribution over data via a scalar energy function $E(\\mathbf{x}; "
"\\theta)$:"
msgstr ""
"与前馈网络不同，能量基模型（Energy-Based Models，EBMs）通过标量能量函数 $E(\\mathbf{x}; \\theta)$ "
"定义数据的概率分布："

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:27
msgid ""
"\n"
"P(\\mathbf{x}; \\theta) = \\frac{\\exp(-E(\\mathbf{x}; \\theta))}{Z(\\theta)}\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"P(\\mathbf{x}; \\theta) = \\frac{\\exp(-E(\\mathbf{x}; \\theta))}{Z(\\theta)}\n"

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:31
msgid "where the partition function is:"
msgstr "其中配分函数（partition function）为："

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:33
msgid ""
"\n"
"Z(\\theta) = \\sum_{\\mathbf{x}} \\exp(-E(\\mathbf{x}; \\theta))\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Z(\\theta) = \\sum_{\\mathbf{x}} \\exp(-E(\\mathbf{x}; \\theta))\n"

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:37
msgid ""
"ensuring normalization. Low energy states correspond to high probability."
msgstr "确保概率归一化。低能量状态对应高概率。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:41
msgid "2. Boltzmann Machine Architecture"
msgstr "2\\. 玻尔兹曼机结构"

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:43
msgid ""
"**Visible layer (v)**: explicit representation of input data (e.g., pixel "
"values)."
msgstr "**可见层（v）**：输入数据的显式表示（如像素值）。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:44
msgid "**Hidden layer (h)**: extracted latent features."
msgstr "**隐层（h）**：提取的潜在特征。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:45
msgid "**Weight matrix (W)**: connections between visible and hidden layers."
msgstr "**权重矩阵（W）**：连接可见层与隐层的权重。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:46
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Biases**: visible bias ($\\mathbf{b}$) and hidden bias ($\\mathbf{c}$)."
msgstr "**偏置**：可见层偏置（$\\mathbf{b}$）和隐层偏置（$\\mathbf{c}$）。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:48
msgid ""
"A Boltzmann Machine (BM) is fully connected, while a Restricted Boltzmann "
"Machine (RBM) removes intra-layer connections, making Gibbs sampling more "
"efficient."
msgstr "玻尔兹曼机（BM）采用全连接拓扑，而受限玻尔兹曼机（RBM）去除了层内连接，使 Gibbs 采样更加高效。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:50
msgid ""
"Due to the restricted structure of RBM, hidden variables are mutually "
"independent given the visible variables, and their conditional probabilities"
" are:"
msgstr "由于 RBM 的受限结构，隐变量在给定可见变量时相互独立，其条件概率为："

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:52
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"P(h_j = 1 \\mid \\mathbf{v}) = \\sigma\\left( \\sum_i w_{ij} v_i + c_j \\right)\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"P(h_j = 1 \\mid \\mathbf{v}) = \\sigma\\left( \\sum_i w_{ij} v_i + c_j \\right)\n"

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:56
msgid "Similarly,"
msgstr "同理，"

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:58
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"P(v_i = 1 \\mid \\mathbf{h}) = \\sigma\\left( \\sum_j w_{ij} h_j + b_i \\right)\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"P(v_i = 1 \\mid \\mathbf{h}) = \\sigma\\left( \\sum_j w_{ij} h_j + b_i \\right)\n"

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:64
msgid "3. Energy Function and Probability Distribution"
msgstr "3\\. 能量函数与概率分布"

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:66
msgid "3.1 Energy Function"
msgstr "3.1 能量函数"

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:68
msgid "The energy function of an RBM is defined as:"
msgstr "RBM 的能量函数定义为："

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:70
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"E(\\mathbf{v}, \\mathbf{h}) = -\\mathbf{v}^T \\mathbf{W} \\mathbf{h} - \\mathbf{b}^T \\mathbf{v} - \\mathbf{c}^T \\mathbf{h}\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"E(\\mathbf{v}, \\mathbf{h}) = -\\mathbf{v}^T \\mathbf{W} \\mathbf{h} - \\mathbf{b}^T \\mathbf{v} - \\mathbf{c}^T \\mathbf{h}\n"

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:74
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"where $\\mathbf{v}, \\mathbf{h}$ are the states of the visible and hidden "
"layers, $\\mathbf{W}$ is the connection weight, and $\\mathbf{b}, "
"\\mathbf{c}$ are bias terms."
msgstr ""
"其中，$\\mathbf{v}, \\mathbf{h}$ 分别是可见层和隐层的状态，$\\mathbf{W}$ "
"是连接的权重，$\\mathbf{b}, \\mathbf{c}$ 为偏置项。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:76
msgid ""
"The joint probability distribution is given by the Boltzmann distribution:"
msgstr "联合概率分布由玻尔兹曼分布给出："

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:78
msgid ""
"\n"
"P(\\mathbf{v}, \\mathbf{h}) = \\frac{e^{-E(\\mathbf{v}, \\mathbf{h})}}{Z}\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"P(\\mathbf{v}, \\mathbf{h}) = \\frac{e^{-E(\\mathbf{v}, \\mathbf{h})}}{Z}\n"

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:82
msgid ""
"where $Z$ is the partition function (normalization factor). The marginal "
"distribution over the visible layer is:"
msgstr "其中 $Z$ 为配分函数（归一化因子）。可见层上的边际分布为："

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:84
msgid ""
"\n"
"P(\\mathbf{v}) = \\sum_{\\mathbf{h}} P(\\mathbf{v}, \\mathbf{h})\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"P(\\mathbf{v}) = \\sum_{\\mathbf{h}} P(\\mathbf{v}, \\mathbf{h})\n"

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:88
msgid ""
"We learn parameters $W, b, c$ by maximizing the likelihood. The objective is"
" the negative log-likelihood:"
msgstr "我们通过最大化似然来学习参数 $W, b, c$。目标函数为负对数似然："

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:90
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathcal{L} = -\\sum_{\\mathbf{v}} \\log P(\\mathbf{v})\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\mathcal{L} = -\\sum_{\\mathbf{v}} \\log P(\\mathbf{v})\n"

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:94
msgid ""
"The Contrastive Divergence (CD) algorithm approximates the gradient, giving "
"the update rule:"
msgstr "对比散度（Contrastive Divergence，CD）算法对梯度进行近似，得到更新规则："

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:96
#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:159
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\Delta W_{ij} = \\epsilon \\left( \\langle v_i h_j \\rangle_{\\text{data}} - \\langle v_i h_j \\rangle_{\\text{recon}} \\right)\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\Delta W_{ij} = \\epsilon \\left( \\langle v_i h_j \\rangle_{\\text{data}} - \\langle v_i h_j \\rangle_{\\text{recon}} \\right)\n"

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:100
msgid ""
"where $\\epsilon$ is the learning rate, $\\langle \\cdot "
"\\rangle_{\\text{data}}$ and $\\langle \\cdot \\rangle_{\\text{recon}}$ are "
"the expectations under the data distribution and the reconstruction "
"distribution, respectively."
msgstr ""
"其中 $\\epsilon$ 为学习率，$\\langle \\cdot \\rangle_{\\text{data}}$ 和 $\\langle "
"\\cdot \\rangle_{\\text{recon}}$ 分别是数据分布与重构分布下的期望。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:102
msgid "3.2 Derivation of the Gradient"
msgstr "3.2 梯度推导"

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:104
msgid "For an energy-based model, the probability can be written as:"
msgstr "对于基于能量的模型，概率可以写成："

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:106
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"p(x; \\theta) = \\frac{1}{Z} \\tilde{p}(x; \\theta)\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"p(x; \\theta) = \\frac{1}{Z} \\tilde{p}(x; \\theta)\n"

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:110
msgid "Its gradient is:"
msgstr "其梯度为："

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:112
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\nabla_\\theta \\log p(x; \\theta) = \\nabla_\\theta \\log \\tilde{p}(x; \\theta) - \\nabla_\\theta \\log Z\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\nabla_\\theta \\log p(x; \\theta) = \\nabla_\\theta \\log \\tilde{p}(x; \\theta) - \\nabla_\\theta \\log Z\n"

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:116
msgid "The gradient of the partition function is not directly computable:"
msgstr "配分函数的梯度无法直接计算："

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:118
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\nabla_\\theta \\log Z\n"
"&= \\frac{\\nabla_\\theta Z}{Z} \\\\\n"
"&= \\frac{\\nabla_\\theta \\sum_x \\tilde{p}(x)}{Z} \\\\\n"
"&= \\sum_x \\frac{\\nabla_\\theta \\tilde{p}(x)}{Z}\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\nabla_\\theta \\log Z\n"
"&= \\frac{\\nabla_\\theta Z}{Z} \\\\\n"
"&= \\frac{\\nabla_\\theta \\sum_x \\tilde{p}(x)}{Z} \\\\\n"
"&= \\sum_x \\frac{\\nabla_\\theta \\tilde{p}(x)}{Z}\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:127
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"For models where $p(x) > 0$ for all $x$, we can replace $\\tilde{p}(x)$ with"
" $\\exp(\\log \\tilde{p}(x))$:"
msgstr ""
"对于所有 $x$ 均满足 $p(x) > 0$ 的模型，可以用 $\\exp(\\log \\tilde{p}(x))$ 替换 "
"$\\tilde{p}(x)$："

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:129
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\frac{\\sum_x \\nabla_\\theta \\exp(\\log \\tilde{p}(x))}{Z}\n"
"&= \\frac{\\sum_x \\exp(\\log \\tilde{p}(x)) \\nabla_\\theta \\log \\tilde{p}(x)}{Z} \\\\\n"
"&= \\frac{\\sum_x \\tilde{p}(x) \\nabla_\\theta \\log \\tilde{p}(x)}{Z} \\\\\n"
"&= \\sum_x p(x) \\nabla_\\theta \\log \\tilde{p}(x) \\\\\n"
"&= \\mathbb{E}_{x \\sim p(x)} \\nabla_\\theta \\log \\tilde{p}(x)\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\frac{\\sum_x \\nabla_\\theta \\exp(\\log \\tilde{p}(x))}{Z}\n"
"&= \\frac{\\sum_x \\exp(\\log \\tilde{p}(x)) \\nabla_\\theta \\log \\tilde{p}(x)}{Z} \\\\\n"
"&= \\frac{\\sum_x \\tilde{p}(x) \\nabla_\\theta \\log \\tilde{p}(x)}{Z} \\\\\n"
"&= \\sum_x p(x) \\nabla_\\theta \\log \\tilde{p}(x) \\\\\n"
"&= \\mathbb{E}_{x \\sim p(x)} \\nabla_\\theta \\log \\tilde{p}(x)\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:139
msgid "Therefore,"
msgstr "因此，"

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:141
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\nabla_\\theta \\log p(x; \\theta) = \\nabla_\\theta \\log \\hat{p}(x; \\theta) - \\mathbb{E}_{x \\sim p(x; \\theta)} \\nabla_\\theta \\log \\hat{p}(x; \\theta)\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\nabla_\\theta \\log p(x; \\theta) = \\nabla_\\theta \\log \\hat{p}(x; \\theta) - \\mathbb{E}_{x \\sim p(x; \\theta)} \\nabla_\\theta \\log \\hat{p}(x; \\theta)\n"

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:145
msgid ""
"The second term involves the model distribution $p(x; \\theta)$, while the "
"first term is from the empirical data distribution. Thus,"
msgstr "第二项涉及模型分布 $p(x; \\theta)$，第一项来自经验数据分布。因此，"

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:147
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\nabla_\\theta \\log p(x; \\theta) = \\mathbb{E}_{x \\sim p_{\\text{data}}} \\nabla_\\theta \\log \\hat{p}(x; \\theta) - \\mathbb{E}_{x \\sim p_{\\text{model}}} \\nabla_\\theta \\log \\hat{p}(x; \\theta)\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\nabla_\\theta \\log p(x; \\theta) = \\mathbb{E}_{x \\sim p_{\\text{data}}} \\nabla_\\theta \\log \\hat{p}(x; \\theta) - \\mathbb{E}_{x \\sim p_{\\text{model}}} \\nabla_\\theta \\log \\hat{p}(x; \\theta)\n"

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:151
msgid "For the Boltzmann machine energy function, we easily obtain:"
msgstr "对于玻尔兹曼机能量函数，我们容易得到："

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:153
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\nabla_W \\log \\hat{p}(x; W) = v h^\\mathrm{T}\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\nabla_W \\log \\hat{p}(x; W) = v h^\\mathrm{T}\n"

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:157
msgid ""
"Hence, the gradient can be computed by sampling $v$ and $h$ under "
"$p_{\\text{data}}$ and $p_{\\text{model}}$, leading to:"
msgstr ""
"因此，梯度可以通过在 $p_{\\text{data}}$ 和 $p_{\\text{model}}$ 下对 $v$ 和 $h$ 采样来计算，从而得到："

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:163
msgid "Further Reading"
msgstr "延伸阅读"

#: ../../source/getting_started/background.md:165
msgid ""
"For a comprehensive treatment of the theoretical foundations behind energy-"
"based models, sampling, and quantum enhancement, refer to the [Theoretical "
"Foundations](../theoretical-foundations/index.md) section of the "
"documentation."
msgstr ""
"关于能量基模型、采样与量子增强背后的理论基础，请参阅文档中的[理论基础](../theoretical-foundations/index.md)章节。"

